# Example CODEOWNERS: protect everything that decides what planguard checks.
# Copy to CODEOWNERS (repository root) or .github/CODEOWNERS and replace the owner.
# It only takes effect together with branch protection ("Require review from Code Owners",
# no bypass for the PR author) and a required status check for the planguard job.
/planguard.toml   @YOUR-ORG/infra-owners
/.github/         @YOUR-ORG/infra-owners
/CODEOWNERS       @YOUR-ORG/infra-owners
